1
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,600
What are you thinking about?

2
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,240
Guess.

3
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:12,920
I don't even need to guess.

4
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:13,720
Jiang Siyao.

5
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:16,520
Besides romance,

6
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,650
can't I think about national affairs?

7
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:20,120
You do,

8
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,570
but you don't say it.

9
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:24,720
I...

10
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,039
Don't feel pressured.

11
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:33,800
We are both fugitives now,

12
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:36,280
in the same boat.

13
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,440
Detective or not,

14
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,400
no more probing.

15
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:39,840
I'm not in the mood for that.

16
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,640
Then what are you in the mood for?

17
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:44,520
I'm simpler than you.

18
00:01:46,039 --> 00:01:47,770
Looking at a scene like this...

19
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:48,880
Hehehe.

20
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:51,740
I really got dragged into this with you guys.

21
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:53,479
Blinded by

22
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,720
youthful hot-bloodedness.

23
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:57,600
What?

24
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,280
Sounds like

25
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,880
you regret joining us.

26
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,240
If right now,

27
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:06,880
I were still in the police station whitewashing the peace,

28
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:08,280
I would indeed regret it.

29
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,440
But honestly,

30
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,280
being blinded by hot-bloodedness

31
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,960
is indeed a bit reckless.

32
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,840
But if time could turn back,

33
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,450
I would still make the same choice.

34
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,640
So,

35
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,480
doing the right thing

36
00:02:22,480 --> 00:02:24,600
is my patriotism.

37
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:28,320
What about your romance?

38
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,440
To be honest,

39
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:30,640
that little Taoist nun

40
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,400
has been unhappy lately.

41
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,840
How should I cheer her up?

42
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,120
How would I know?

43
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:36,640
True.

44
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,960
She's practically throwing herself at you,

45
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,600
and you're still playing hard to get.

46
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,840
What are you doing?

47
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:45,920
Forget it.

48
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:46,920
We have wine here,

49
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,240
let's speak our minds freely.

50
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:48,720
Come on.

51
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:02,760
Now thieves fill the Central Plains,

52
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,880
we should stand by the river with spears.

53
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:08,770
Then I'll follow up.

54
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,130
With a jade ruyi,

55
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,090
commanding with elegance,

56
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,080
astonishing everyone present.

57
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,880
Oh,

58
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,360
With a golden goblet,

59
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,640
pouring freely,

60
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,280
never getting drunk after a thousand cups.

61
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,800
Never getting drunk, never getting drunk.

62
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:26,260
Come on.

63
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,290
You've got some skills.

64
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:31,920
You taught me.

65
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:32,980
Come on.

66
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,480
Eat.

67
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,000
Look who's here.

68
00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:41,320
A wanted fugitive

69
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:44,340
coming to my place in the middle of the night.

70
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:47,540
Could it be out of nostalgia for a former colleague?

71
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,920
I'm not just nostalgic,

72
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:52,540
I also remember an old acquaintance.

73
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:54,220
What are you trying to say?

74
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,360
Five years ago,

75
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,360
in Wei Xiaodong's case,

76
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,690
you knew who the real killer was all along.

77
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,360
The real murder weapon

78
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:03,370
was the Spear of Longinus from the girls' school.

79
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:05,040
You clearly knew,

80
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,360
but chose to hide it.

81
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,800
Look.

82
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:18,760
What is this?

83
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,760
I secretly took a picture of this

84
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,279
at the Thomas Church Girls' School.

85
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:23,210
It seems to be used by their church.

86
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,880
The wounds match.

87
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,760
If it weren't for you five years ago,

88
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:59,480
I wouldn't have botched that case,

89
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,410
and caused a wrongful conviction.

90
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,900
That was because you were too impulsive.

91
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:08,080
Don't shift the blame to others.

92
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,690
I didn't want to shift the blame to you.

93
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:12,280
I just feel sorry for you.

94
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,240
I don't need you to remind me.

95
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:19,600
Didn't you want to catch me for credit?

96
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,080
Come on.

97
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,040
You can do it now.

98
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,120
Forget it.

99
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,620
I still value our old friendship.

100
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,600
Just go.

101
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:49,170
I just wanted to remind you.

102
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:51,440
It's not too late to turn back now.

103
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:53,370
Do you know what I've been through?

104
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,480
Turn back?

105
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,280
Turn back?

106
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,600
Is it still not too late?

107
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:19,040
The last sum has been transferred.

108
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,320
The money went through William Bank.

109
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:21,680
Black Mass in the UK

110
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,440
has already received it.

111
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:24,570
Now the Jiuhe Gang and the foreign firm

112
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,800
have been taken over by Lei Lie's son,

113
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,720
Lei Zijun.

114
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,050
Everything is as usual.

115
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:33,480
Send someone to keep an eye on Lei Zijun.

116
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,360
At this time,

117
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,159
there can be no mistakes.

118
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,960
Don't worry, sir.

119
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,280
I've already sent someone over.

120
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:46,280
Have you been to the San Fasi Winery?

121
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,080
Where?

122
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:48,560
San Wasi.

123
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,800
Never been there.

124
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,760
What kind of filthy place is this?

125
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,120
Just stop getting involved

126
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,120
with them, okay?

127
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:56,880
Becoming the head of the Huo family is your destiny.

128
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:59,720
Protecting the Huo family is my destiny.

129
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:03,640
Sir,

130
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,850
what can I do for you?

131
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,180
There's an emergency.

132
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,280
My men reported that

133
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:09,250
Zeng Guoquan

134
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,650
is about to run away.

135
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,600
He found out so quickly

136
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,260
that we have the key evidence?

137
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,240
We can't let him get away.

138
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,760
But the current situation

139
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:19,020
poses no threat to him.

140
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:20,040
Why would he run?

141
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,530
After all these years of

142
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,680
corruption,

143
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:24,440
he knows he won't end up well.

144
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:27,850
He's been planning to live abroad for a long time.

145
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:28,600
Okay,

146
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,560
I understand.

147
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:31,760
Young Master,

148
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:32,560
we found them.

149
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,400
They are in a small courtyard

150
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:35,800
in Yangliu Village in the western suburbs.

151
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,800
Got it.

152
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:39,360
If we tell the police or the foreigners about this,

153
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,520
they're dead meat.

154
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,320
No rush.

155
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,400
Liangzi,

156
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,200
I want to ask you,

157
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:48,280
is my father really

158
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:50,740
helping foreigners smuggle illegal drugs?

159
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:51,400
Young Master,

160
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,600
but this Jiang Siyao,

161
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,720
she's no good.

162
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,280
She only took this case to get a promotion.

163
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,720
As a result, she investigated the foreigners

164
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:58,920
and hit a brick wall.

165
00:07:59,159 --> 00:08:00,760
To appease the public anger,

166
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:02,320
she killed the Master

167
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,840
and pinned all the blame on him.

168
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,400
But

169
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:10,080
how come I heard that this Li Chengrui

170
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:12,720
and Jiang Siyao don't get along?

171
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:15,080
That's all an act.

172
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:18,440
Li Chengrui had an affair with Jiang Siyao six years ago.

173
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:21,240
Jiang Siyao was the one giving Li Chengrui orders.

174
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:26,280
Young Master,

175
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:28,800
let's hurry and tell the police about this.

176
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:30,240
No need.

177
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,760
I will avenge my father myself.

178
00:08:41,679 --> 00:08:43,559
Why did Zeng Guoquan run away?

179
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:46,610
Someone has the evidence he holds.

180
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:49,740
He definitely has ties to the Satan Society.

181
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,240
Oh no,

182
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,380
Ningning ran away.

183
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,000
My lady,

184
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,560
what are you looking for?

185
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:27,360
How long are you going to keep pretending with me?

186
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,890
What are you talking about?

187
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:31,240
You were the one who told the police station

188
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:33,160
that we found the San Fasi Winery,

189
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,160
right?

190
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:37,040
I really forgot about that.

191
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:39,480
What exactly do you want to know?

192
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:40,720
You

193
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:43,960
are my biological father,

194
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:45,600
right?

195
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:47,760
My lady,

196
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,600
you can't just say things like that.

197
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,080
We are generations apart.

198
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:54,260
For the above two answers,

199
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:57,440
your expression when answering was exactly the same,

200
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,600
which means you are lying.

201
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:01,760
Alright.

202
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,640
About this San Fasi Winery,

203
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:06,560
I do know a thing or two,

204
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:08,320
but I was absolutely not involved.

205
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,120
I

206
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:12,520
have been investigating this Zeng Guoquan.

207
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,130
Come take a look at this.

208
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:16,120
Is this what you're looking for?

209
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,160
This

210
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:25,290
is the evidence of Zeng Guoquan

211
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:26,960
transferring his assets

212
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:29,090
through the William Trading Company.

213
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:32,010
If you want to help Jiang Siyao,

214
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,880
take it.

215
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,080
So,

216
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:37,280
you and Zeng Guoquan

217
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,180
are not working together.

218
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:41,240
You've also been investigating Zeng Guoquan.

219
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,040
That's right.

220
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,320
I

221
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,000
just care about you

222
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,860
and am afraid you'll be in danger.

223
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:48,480
You can take this ledger,

224
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,740
but I have one request.

225
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,640
You are not allowed to take risks alone.

226
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,520
Then send your troops

227
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:56,960
and come with me to save my senior sister.

228
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:57,920
No problem.

229
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,120
Here.

230
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:01,880
This is the Huo family's token.

231
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:04,520
The whole Fenghuang City will show us respect.

232
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:05,320
Take it.

233
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,200
Go.

234
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,760
Is what you just said

235
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,080
all true?

236
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,120
Ningning.

237
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,920
You only need to know

238
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,000
that for you,

239
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,440
I would die.
